      ],
      "en": "The people said to Samuel, “Who is he who said, ‘Shall Saul reign over us?’ Bring those men, that we may put them to death!”",
      "ko": "백성이 사무엘에게 이르되 사울이 어찌 우리를 다스리겠느냐 한 자가 누구니이까 그들을 끌어내소서 우리가 죽이겠나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "f70247b39a85aacf00ac5d5e1608f1cbd7e646d5c9b5d7f4159759204f989ea6",
      "translation_text_hash": "d4c0ffbc29a33f58285ae52a7e20925a6cf9ff4186c56eec5b6f5510e6d9cf2d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
